.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:15:# Deep Review State Log Records
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:21:## 1. OVERVIEW
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:23:### Purpose
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:27:### When to Use
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:34:### Key Sources
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:45:## 2. STATE LOG (DEEP-REVIEW-STATE.JSONL)
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:49:### Line 1: Config Record
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:55:### Iteration Records
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:108:### Convergence Signals
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:119:### Graph Events
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:149:#### Event payload shape
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:161:#### Namespace Rules (REQ-028, REQ-029)
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:167:1. **Session-local uniqueness**: within one session, an `id` must resolve to exactly one node (or edge) for its entire lifetime. Re-emitting the same `id` is an upsert against the existing row in that session only.
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:168:2. **No cross-session global uniqueness requirement**: callers MUST NOT prefix ids with the session id or random salt to "avoid collisions". The DB layer handles namespace isolation. Salting ids only makes provenance harder to read.
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:169:3. **Edge source/target locality**: `source` and `target` in an edge event must name nodes already present in the same namespace. Cross-session edges are not a supported shape.
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:170:4. **Persistence gate**: the reducer refuses to roll graph events forward when a record is missing `sessionId` on the surrounding iteration record, because the DB cannot route the write.
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:174:### Synthesis Event
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:188:### Blocked-Stop Event
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:225:### Graph Convergence Event
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:256:### Normalized Pause and Recovery Events
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-jsonl.md:296:### Verdict Rules
