.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-format.md:222:1. Read current strategy file
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-format.md:223:2. Move completed dimensions from "remaining" to "completed" with `[x]` and verdict
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-format.md:224:3. Update running-findings with P0/P1/P2 counts and deltas
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-format.md:225:4. Add to what-worked / what-failed with iteration number
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-format.md:226:5. Move exhausted approaches. Update cross-reference-status and files-under-review
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-format.md:227:6. Set next-focus based on remaining dimensions and open findings
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/state/state-format.md:231:## 5. FINDINGS REGISTRY (deep-review-findings-registry.json)
